<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>SOS</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#f8fafc;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1e293b;padding:16px}
.box{width:100%;max-width:340px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:20px;padding:24px;text-align:center}
h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 6px}
p{font-size:13px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 16px}
#sos{background:#e11d48;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 32px;font:600 15px inherit;font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}
#sos:hover{background:#be123c}
#sos:active{transform:scale(.97)}
#done{display:none;background:#fff1f2;border:1px solid #fecdd3;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;font-size:14px;color:#9f1239;font-weight:600}
#done span{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:#be123c;margin-top:4px}
#undo{background:none;border:0;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;}

</style>

</head>
<body>
<div class="box">
<h2>Emergency SOS</h2>
<p>Tap the button to alert the nearest police station.</p>
<button id="sos">SOS</button>
<div id="done">
Nearest police station has been informed.
<span>Your location has been shared.</span>
<button id="undo">Sent by mistake? Cancel</button>
</div>
</div>

</script>
</body>
</html>